      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006E20190065006E00200076006F0075006C0065007A00200070006C00750073002C002000660069006E0061006C0065006D0065006E00740020003F00100001BE010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois que vous n’avez pas assez de\nMéga-Fragments pour cela.<U+0010><U+0001>븁",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
